#%PAM-1.0
# HelixOS Dual Space (helixos-spacesd): which space a password opens. The login itself goes
# through greetd's own stack.
#
# pam_faillock is left out on purpose: one password is tried against every space, and faillock
# would count that as failures on the spaces it did not match. spacesd rate-limits instead.
# nodelay: no 2-second delay per non-matching space; spacesd applies its own lockout.
auth      required  pam_unix.so nodelay
account   required  pam_unix.so
